answers.workaround:
Yes, this behavior can be worked around, but the workaround comes at the cost of clarity, encapsulation, and developer ergonomics.

```gdscript
@export var alpha: float = 1:
	set = set_alpha

@onready var icon = $Icon

func _ready():
	set_alpha(alpha)

func set_alpha(value: float) -> void:
	alpha = value
	if is_instance_valid(icon):
		icon.modulate.a = value
```
